    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhusitaakwa khwaPaulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olunyuma lwetsindaalo tsiraano Omukuhani Omukhulundu Anania yakholomokha halala nende abakofu bandi, khandi nende omutereli undi, mbu Terutulo; nibamuboolela kafuna amakhuwa akokhumufukula Paulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yalangwa, Terutulo yachaaka okhumwinjilila, ari Olwa kali mbu niwe ouchila nikhumenya eshisiche mulembe, khandi mbu akali nikabiiyile mwihanga lino kakasibungwa khulwa obulindibwo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khukabukula buli lwosi kata buli hosi nende okhwishia muno, owoluyali Feliki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mbu endeshe okhukhuchoonyia, ekhusaaya mbu khulwa obukoosiabwo okhuhulile mumakhuwa amatuutu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba khunyoolile omundu uno nali eshinoko shiokhunyasia, khandi noubuusinjia induli mubaYahudi abomubialo biosi, khandi nomwimilisi womwahukho kwabaNazorayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi yateema okhwonoonia ihekalu yeefwe; neefu nikhumuhamba, [nikhwenya okhumuyaasia amalako keefwe shinga olwa kali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omuseesia omukhulundu Lisia niyeetsa, namurimula mumakhono keefwe nende amahababa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nalaka abeenjililibe okhwitsa imbeliwo.] Ne iwe omwene, nomureebelesiye, witsa okhunyoola khuye omwene amakhuwa ako kosi shinga olwa kali aka khumwinjiliile ninako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbaYahudi nabo niboongana ninaye mubwinjilili obwo, nibatinyisia mbu nolwa amakhuwa ako kali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo yeeteetsa imbeli waFeliki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa kafuna yali namusimile mbu aboole, Paulo yakalusia, mbu Okhuba emanyile shinga olwa wabeelenje omuyaasii weshiina khwihanga lino emiyika eminji, kho emboola akokhwiteetsa khwanje nobusangaali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhuba onyala okhumanya mbu shitsili tsindaalo etsishila ekhumi natsibili okhurula olwa ndatikulukha ninzia eYerusalemu okhwinamilayo Nyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne shibayanyoola muhekalu niyingananga nende omundu yesi, kata okhubuusia indiri mubandu, kata mutsisinagogi kata mwitookho ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata amakhuwa aka banzinjiliile ninako bulaano, shibanyala okhulolosia mbu nakatoto imbeliwo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kano ndiyama imbeliwo, mbu ekhalabanilanga Nyasaye wabakuuka beefwe khuNjila yeneyo eya balanga mbu omwahukho, nisuubilanga amakhuwa kosi akali akamalako, kata akahandiikwa mubitabu biabanabii; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi nobunaayi khuNyasaye obwa kata bano abeene balindiililanga, mbu bulibaho obulamushi bwabalunjishi nende abarali abalunjishi ta, bosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khulwa likhuwa elo endeemanga shinga olwa enyala okhuba nomwoyo okubula eshiuku imbeli waNyasaye nende abandu tsindaalo tsiosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano, inyuma wemiyika echihelile ndayeetsile okhuleerela lihanga lieefwe ebietsimbabasi nende ebihaanwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nikholanga endio, banyoola nisiiyilwe nindi muhekalu, omukanda nikubulaho kata indiri yosi ta; ne baliho abaYahudi bandi abarula ebuAsia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nabo babeele nibakhoyeele babe hano imbeliwo, mbu banzinjilile, nibaba nibali nende likhuwa liosi khwisie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata abandu bano abeene babuule, mbu neshionoono shiina eshia banyoola nindi ninashio, olwa ndasinjila imbeli weshiina, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habula nilili lisungo lino elala lionyene elia ndalanjilisia nisinjiile mubo, mbu Eyaasibungwa imbeli weenywe inyanga yino khulwa amakhuwa kobulamushi bwabafu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo yalindwa mubuhambe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa Feliki, olwa yamanya habwene amakhuwa keInjila eyo, yabalaka mbu balinde, ari Olwa Lisi a omuseesia omukhulundu aliba niyeetsile, ndilikhalaka amakhuwa keenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nalaka omuseesia mbu alindwe bulayi, ne mbu alekhuulungwekhwo; khandi mbu arakaania omundu yesi owomubeetsabe oburamukhalabanila ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nolunyuma Iwetsindaalokhwo, Feliki niyeetsa halala nende Durusila omukhasiwe, owali omuYahudi, narumana okhulanga Paulo, nahulila khuye amakhuwa kobusuubilili muKristo Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yakhupa imbakha khumakhuwa kobulunjishi, nobwiruchi, nende eshiina eshiitsa okhubaho, indenga yamutiila Feliki, mana nasunga ari Onyala okhutsia bulaano; ninyoolile obwiyangu ndakhakhulanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi yali nanaayanga mbu yakhanyoola amapeesa khuPaulo; niko akachila narumananga okhumulanga khandi akhanji, nabuutsanga ninaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.24.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
